63
00:02:27.086 --> 00:02:27.930
Yeah, you don't remember that,

64
00:02:27.930 --> 00:02:28.900
no, I don't think,

65
00:02:28.900 --> 00:02:30.423
you weren't on the set.

66
00:02:31.440 --> 00:02:34.000 line:15%
Something happened and one of

67
00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:35.996 line:15%
