69
00:02:38.820 --> 00:02:42.157 line:15%
They went huh, and Steven went huah!

70
00:02:43.557 --> 00:02:44.561
That's so Steven.

71
00:02:44.561 --> 00:02:45.563
Yeah, just-

72
00:02:45.563 --> 00:02:47.780
Here's a fun fact.

73
00:02:47.780 --> 00:02:51.593
Steven, my daughter, Frankie,

74
00:02:52.820 --> 00:02:54.910
