80
00:03:10.300 --> 00:03:11.470 line:15%
How awesome is that.

81
00:03:11.470 --> 00:03:13.828 line:15%
I think it's pretty apropos.

82
00:03:13.828 --> 00:03:17.688
Exactly, it's synonymous with the profession.

83
00:03:17.688 --> 00:03:21.270
Well, I really, from what I remember

84
00:03:21.270 --> 00:03:24.708
"E.T." was kept alive on set at all times.

85
00:03:24.708 --> 00:03:28.020
I mean, I would go have lunch with "E.T." a lot.

86
00:03:28.020 --> 00:03:30.030
