107
00:04:22.980 --> 00:04:23.967
Yes, yes.

108
00:04:23.967 --> 00:04:26.442
And Steven got me to cry.

109
00:04:26.442 --> 00:04:27.753
Oh, no.

110
00:04:29.630 --> 00:04:30.463 line:15%
Okay.

111
00:04:30.463 --> 00:04:32.473 line:15%
So this is how it went down.

112
00:04:34.698 --> 00:04:37.200 line:15%
Being the mother that I am with all the kids

113
00:04:37.200 --> 00:04:38.890 line:15%
