125
00:05:11.880 --> 00:05:15.440
You took one look at E.T. and went (crying),

126
00:05:16.607 --> 00:05:19.850
"Ah, he's dying, Dee, he's dying."

127
00:05:19.850 --> 00:05:23.017
(audience applauding)

128
00:05:25.520 --> 00:05:26.960
You were always so kind to me.

129
00:05:26.960 --> 00:05:29.190
